---
<footer class="bg-black pt-24 pb-12 border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-12 md:gap-8 mb-20">
      <div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-black" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-white font-bold text-lg tracking-tight">Genius</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
          Empowering the workforce with artificial intelligence to find more meaningful work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">Product</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li><a href="#features" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-emerald-500 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">Features</a></li>
          <li><a href="#analysis" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-emerald-500 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">Analysis</a></li>
          <li><a href="#pricing" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-emerald-500 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">Pricing</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">Company</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li><a href="#about" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-emerald-500 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">About Us</a></li>
          <li><a href="#careers" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-emerald-500 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">Careers</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-emerald-500 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">Legal</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li><a href="/privacy" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-emerald-500 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terms" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-emerald-500 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">Terms of Service</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">Social</h4>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <a href="#" class="w-10 h-10 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400 hover:text-emerald-500 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect width="4" height="12" x="2" y="9"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#" class="w-10 h-10 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400 hover:text-emerald-500 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all">
